# DUB.SAR 1.0 — Tablet Archive (Scholar Mode)
# Demonstrates persistent tablet consultation, working scratchpads, and inscription.

problem

    consult tablet "reciprocals"

    reciprocal-of-four :
        4
        take entry from reciprocals

    working observations

    put 42 into observations at 10

    inscribe observations as tablet "observations"

    recorded-entry :
        10
        take entry from observations

result

    reciprocal-of-four
